\begin{proposition}\label{hhnl}
The functor $\Omega: \infty\Cat_* \to \infty\Cat_*$ lifts to a
functor $\Omega: \infty\Cat_* \to \Mon(\infty\Cat)$ along the forgetful functor.
The functor $\Omega: \infty\Cat_* \to \Mon(\infty\Cat)$ admits a fully faithful left adjoint $B:\Mon(\infty\Cat) \to \infty\Cat_* $ that preserves finite products
whose essential image precisely consists of the connected $\infty$-categories with distinguished object.

