In the following we apply the theory of enriched categories \cite{GEPNER2015575}, \cite{HEINE2023108941}, \cite{heine2024equivalencemodelsinftycategoriesenriched}, \cite{HINICH2020107129} to the Gray monoidal structure on $\infty\Cat$ and the Gray smash monoidal structure on $\infty\Cat_*.$ 
