A zero object is an initial and final object.

\begin{definition}
A (left) (right) Gray-category is reduced if it admits a zero object.
A (left) (right) Gray-functor %between reduced (strict) (left) (right) Gray-categories 
is reduced if it preserves the zero object.
\end{definition}

