The Gray-category $\Sp(\mC)$ is compactly generated and the full subcategory of compact objects $\Sp(\mC)^\omega $ is the  sequential colimit of the diagram of small reduced Gray-categories:
$$\mC^\omega \xrightarrow{\Sigma} (\mC^\omega)^\cop  \xrightarrow{\Sigma} ... $$	
