In particular, the Gray-category $\Sp(\mC)$ is oplax quasi-stable.

%$$ K ot F(X) \to F(K ot X)$$ Mor(KotX,F)  to Mor(KotF(X),Y)C(KotX,-) ot K = C(X,-)^K ot K to C(X,-)  $$ Mor(C(X,-),F)=F(X) to Mor(C(KotX,-)otK,F)= Mor(C(KotX,-),F^K)=F(KotX)^K$

\end{proposition}

\begin{proof}
The functor $\Omega :\Sp(\mC) \to \Sp(\mC)$ is the functor on limits induced by the map of sequential diagrams:
$$\begin{xy}
\xymatrix{
 \ar[d]^{\Omega}
& \ar[d]^{\Omega}
\\ 	
\mC \ar[d]^{\Omega} \ar[r]^{\Omega}
& \mC \ar[d]^{\Omega}
\\ 
\mC \ar[d]^{\Omega} \ar[r]^{\Omega}
& \mC \ar[d]^{\Omega}
\\ 
\mC \ar[r]^{\Omega} & \mC,
}
