where each square commutes via the equivalence ${\Omega} \circ {\Omega} \simeq {\Omega} \circ {\Omega}$ 
induced by the equivalence $\tau: S^1 \wedge S^1 \simeq \Sigma(S^1) \simeq \Sigma'((S^1)^{\co\op})
\simeq \Sigma'(S^1) \simeq S^1 \wedge S^1$ of \cref{ahoit}.
