%\begin{notation}The Gray-functor $$ {\Fun\wedge}(\mathrm{Sph},\infty\Cat) \to \infty\Cat$$ evaluating at the zero sphere is a lax homology theory and so uniquely lifts to a Gray-functor $$\nu: {\Fun\wedge}(\mathrm{Sph},\infty\Cat) \to \Sp.$$\end{notation}

