\end{proof}

\begin{example}

Let $\mC$ be a symmetric monoidal $\infty$-category. The categorical spectrum $$B^\infty(\mC):= (\mC, B\mC, B^2\mC, ...)$$ with the natural bonding maps is connective.

\end{example}

