corresponds to a right Gray-functor $\alpha^X_n: S(S^1) \to \mC$.
The family of right Gray-functors $\alpha^X_n: S(S^1) \to \mC$ for $n \geq 0$
determines a right Gray-functor $$\alpha^X: S(S^1)\coprod_{\bD^0} S(S^1) \coprod_{\bD^0} ... \to \mC .$$
