the restriction $$\gamma: \mH(\mD) \subset {\Fun\wedge}(\infty\Cat_*,\mD) \to \mD$$ is excisive
and so uniquely lifts to a oplax excisive Gray-functor $$\bar{\gamma}: \mH(\mD)\to \Sp(\mD),$$
