\begin{corollary} \label{coufo}
Let $k \geq 0.$ There are canonical equivalences in $\Fun(\Theta^\op, \mS): $

\begin{enumerate}
\item $$ \coprod_{n \geq0} \D^n \circ \N(\bD^k)\simeq \N(\coprod_{n \geq0} (\bD^k)^{\vee n}) .$$
