the localization of $$ \colim_{n \geq0} \D^n \circ \N(\bD^k) \simeq \colim_{n \geq0} \N(\bD^k)^{\times n}_{\Sigma_n}  \simeq \colim_{n \geq0} \N((\bD^k)^{\times n})_{\Sigma_n}  \in \Fun(\Theta^\op, \Set) $$
with respect to the localization $  \Fun(\Theta^\op, \Set) \to \infty\Cat^\strict. $ 
By \cref{coufo} the presheaf $$ \colim_{n \geq0} \D^n \circ \N(\bD^k) \in \Fun(\Theta^\op, \Set) $$ is $ \N( \colim_{n \geq 0} (\bD^k)^{\vee n})$ and so is local. Hence the free strict symmetric monoidal strict $\infty$-category on $\bD^k$ is $ \colim_{n \geq 0} (\bD^k)^{\vee n} $. So the objects of (4) and (5) are equivalent.	
\end{proof}

