\begin{notation}\label{realiz}

Let $|-|: \Fun(\Delta^\op, \Set^{t\Delta^\op}) \cong \s\Set^{t\Delta^\op}\rightleftarrows \Set^{t\Delta^\op}: \Sing $ 
be the unique left adjoint $\Set^{t\Delta^\op}$-linear functor extending the functor $\Delta \to \Set^{t\Delta^\op}, [n] \mapsto (\Delta^n)^{\#}$ along the embedding
$\Delta \subset  \Fun(\Delta^\op, \Set) \to \Fun(\Delta^\op, \Set^{t\Delta^\op})$ induced by the diagonal embedding $\iota: \Set\to \Set^{t\Delta^\op}$.

