\begin{proof}

A monad on $\mV$ in the 2-category $\Mod_\mV(\widehat{\Cat})$
is an associative algebra in the monoidal category $\Enr\Fun_\mV^L(\mV,\mV)$.
%which lies over a monad on $\mV$ in the 2-category $\widehat{\Cat}.$
