Let $\mC$ be an oplax quasi-stable Gray-category. Oplax quasi-stability gives that $ {\wedge\Oplax\Exc^\mH\wedge}(\mC, \mD) \subset {\wedge\Fun\wedge}(\mC, \mD) $ precisely consists of the reduced Gray-functors preserving endomorphisms and $\mH$-weighted limits. \
In particular, for every lax quasi-stable Gray-category $\mC$ the Gray-Yoneda-embedding induces a Gray-embedding $$\mC \hookrightarrow {\wedge\Op\lax\Exc^\mH \wedge}(\mC^\circ, \infty\Cat_*\boxplus \infty\Cat_*)$$ 
