{\wedge\Lax\Exc^\mH\wedge}(\mC, \mD \boxplus \Sp(\mE)) \subset {\wedge\Fun\wedge}(\mC, \mD \boxplus \Sp(\mE)), $$$$ {\wedge\Exc^\mH\wedge}(\mC,\Sp^\co(\mD) \boxplus \Sp(\mE)) \subset {\wedge\Fun\wedge}(\mC, \Sp^\co(\mD) \boxplus \Sp(\mE))$$ are closed under endomorphisms, coendomorphisms, suspensions and cosuspensions, and so are oplax stable, lax stable, stable, respectively.

