We obtain the following theorem as an immediate corollary:

\begin{theorem}\label{spectral}
\begin{enumerate}

\item Every oplax quasi-stable Gray-category $\mC$ underlies a right spectral Gray-category $\bar{\mC}.$ 

\item Every lax quasi-stable Gray-category $\mC$ underlies a left spectral Gray-category $\bar{\mC}.$ 

\item Every quasi-stable Gray-category $\mC$ underlies a spectral Gray-category $\bar{\mC}.$ 
\end{enumerate}		
\end{theorem}

We obtain the following important corollaries:

