\item A left spectral Gray-category is lax quasi-stable if it is reduced and its underlying spectral left Gray-category is lax quasi-stable.		

\item A right spectral Gray-category is oplax quasi-stable if it is reduced and its underlying spectral right Gray-category is oplax quasi-stable.	

\item A spectral Gray-category is quasi-stable if it is reduced and its underlying spectral left Gray-category is lax quasi-stable and its underlying spectral right Gray-category is oplax quasi-stable.
