Let $H: \infty\Cat_* \to \mathrm{Lad}\infty\Cat_* $
be an categorical homology theory and $X \in \infty\Cat$.
Then $H(X \wedge S^\bullet)$ is a spectrum and we write
$H_*(X)$ for $\Pi_*(H(X \wedge S^\bullet)).$
