Since the NVIDIA A6000 GPU used in our experiment solely has 48G memory, the model cannot handle particularly long prompts.
In order to allow the model to handle longer prompts, \ding{182}~we retained the first two layers of the models for inference, so that more memory in the GPU could be used for calculations rather than storage of model weight parameters.
