Consequently, we get an crafted evaluation dataset with 100 prompt samples. 

In addition, as toy-retnet-1.3B only supports the fp32 data type, fp32 numerical precision is adopted along the experiments.
To alleviate the impacts of the GPU startup time in benchmarking computation methods, we conducted $7$ experiments in succession; 
