	\end{align}
	If \(2r + 2\rho p(b - r) + \rho^2 p^2(\xi^2 + \sigma^2) - \lambda \neq 0\), then we derive $\ba$ from \eqref{eq:bara0} as
	\begin{align}\label{eq:bara}
