Then, the result on the MFE of the MFG problem is stated as follows.}
	\begin{theorem}
		Suppose that \(\lambda\neq r\), \(\lambda\neq 2r\), and \(Q_{\scriptscriptstyle m}\neq 0\),
		\begin{itemize}
			\item[$(1)$] if \(\big(\overline{\underline{br}k_2}-1\big)\big(\overline{\sigma k_1}-1\big)-\overline{\sigma k_2}\cdot\overline{\underline{br}k_1} \neq 0\), the MFE for the representative agent is
