\begin{proof}
First, from \eqref{eq:bara}, \eqref{eq:a1}, \eqref{eq:c1}, \eqref{eq:e1}, \eqref{eq:p1},  and \eqref{eq:q2}, through straightforward calculations, we derive that, as \(\lambda\to\infty\), for $i=1,\ldots,n$,
